.TH DANBY-SWING2 1
.SH NAME
danby-swing2 \- pump a swing with rhythmic torque
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swing2
.SH DESCRIPTION
This companion swing model keeps the pendulum length fixed and applies a
periodic body torque.  Comparing its phase and amplitude with
.IR swing1 (1)
separates torque pumping from centre-of-mass pumping.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps while paused,
R resets, and Q exits.
